request.description:
Client-streaming. Service lifesure.underwriting.UnderwritingService, method SubmitMedicalHistory.

Steps: fill quote_id and base_monthly_premium.minor_units from GetQuote's response, click Invoke to send this context message first, then click Send for each of the following three messages in order, then End Streaming to get the single UnderwritingDecision back:

1) {"record": {"type": "RECORD_TYPE_CONDITION", "description": "controlled hypertension", "severity": 3}}
2) {"record": {"type": "RECORD_TYPE_MEDICATION", "description": "lisinopril, daily", "severity": 2}}
3) {"record": {"type": "RECORD_TYPE_LIFESTYLE", "description": "non-smoker, occasional alcohol", "severity": 1}}

Bidirectional streaming. Service lifesure.claims.ClaimsService, method ProcessClaim.

Steps: click Invoke to send this OPENED event first (a CLAIM_STAGE_RECEIVED update comes back with the server-assigned claim_id -- copy it into the claim_id variable), then Send each of the following in order, reading the status update after each:

1) {"policy_id": "{{policy_id}}", "type": "CLAIM_EVENT_TYPE_DOCUMENT_SUBMITTED", "detail": "discharge summary"}
2) {"policy_id": "{{policy_id}}", "type": "CLAIM_EVENT_TYPE_DOCUMENT_SUBMITTED", "detail": "itemized invoice"}
3) {"policy_id": "{{policy_id}}", "type": "CLAIM_EVENT_TYPE_CLOSED", "detail": "all documents submitted"}

Then End Streaming.
